            <div xml:id="m-33848760-3a12-473f-8e56-807fd8e6b1b8">
              <lg xml:id="m-105c19d7-c093-45bc-bdfc-d64e97c1d50e">
                <l xml:id="m-33330245-e6aa-4f52-8917-d803301400b4" facs="#m-3c3e28ab-f5ab-4faf-bbf0-2460c5866e68" label="text-like">27Saturdays in honour of the B. V. M. Mass I.</l><l xml:id="m-22425a1e-dd5e-41be-ac87-017daf996343" facs="#m-8535eb6c-27b1-4a4b-a670-c9ceb3991f9b" label="lyrics-like">gló-ri-ae.</l><l xml:id="m-780b40e6-2df4-4492-9d05-f397ac94d179" facs="#m-b23f41ee-c9e7-437c-9f4a-19c04a0776cc" label="ambiguous">Rex</l><l xml:id="m-91b4600a-3057-42c9-955c-e255bfdbff91" facs="#m-eda7333a-e5d0-4c15-8f04-691a98f05cb0" label="lyrics-like">V. Quis ascéndet</l><l xml:id="m-3b54838e-1ece-4da3-a9c5-ab2beea63166" facs="#m-db5ab09f-b488-47ea-a9f6-4de90bc668ca" label="lyrics-like">in móntem Dó- mi¬ ni?</l><l xml:id="m-5a2f044b-25a4-44a8-9d45-6aae87e538d6" facs="#m-f7cbbfea-cf79-4916-b2c3-903e1ba09ee5" label="lyrics-like">aut quis stábit in lóco sáncto é¬</l><l xml:id="m-3fe891ab-a7ca-48f1-b250-276e169976f1" facs="#m-db582515-7aa4-4e61-8717-af29051a64ae" label="ambiguous">jus?</l><l xml:id="m-59aca497-bf81-49fd-9bfc-bffd18212166" facs="#m-d3f04ab8-9624-4bbb-9502-18a2b056ceda" label="ambiguous">nibus</l><l xml:id="m-4c04a13b-0c8e-4ab8-ab74-74f085338412" facs="#m-6c8b14e9-79be-4951-b3e6-e5ca10d15cd4" label="lyrics-like">Innocens má¬</l><l xml:id="m-20bb1384-b7f2-46fe-88f3-2117178fc511" facs="#m-9184ead6-2366-4b72-9848-2363f21eee27" label="lyrics-like">et múndo“ cór-de.</l><l xml:id="m-82bbcc88-7caf-4299-abc9-15715ce26b7f" facs="#m-15153136-de81-4ac1-871a-6b2eeb7e5f74" label="lyrics-like">Allelúia, allelúia. V. Ave María. p. 1265.</l><l xml:id="m-a85fea47-5028-4296-9d78-a3373da25db6" facs="#m-32df5554-27c4-4b25-8f5f-0d6d80afb435" label="ambiguous">Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Lucam. Luc. T. c.</l><l xml:id="m-d0c71c23-7386-4d82-b4f7-f5f929c6545b" facs="#m-5aae553f-5cf0-446a-a734-b9f944ab8c96" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore: Missus est An-[ dem David patris ejus: et regnábit</l><l xml:id="m-89681974-251a-4971-b9a1-efe0ab6799d9" facs="#m-cee02db3-34ca-49cf-830e-eb4ef42c7e31" label="lyrics-like">L gelus Gábriel a Deo in civitátem</l><l xml:id="m-c2fab55a-6092-49ce-8a60-ba4eeda42eed" facs="#m-44e1c159-a524-4246-ac31-5a1078144da5" label="lyrics-like">in domo lacob in aetérnum, et re¬</l><l xml:id="m-06c46324-38f6-4d09-bfe3-87bb2c8d306d" facs="#m-16eed5c9-c239-43d5-aa28-9cbc6340a9ac" label="lyrics-like">Galilaéae, cui nomen Názareth, ad</l><l xml:id="m-eff387af-976a-435f-8f76-c759f2bdcf39" facs="#m-21405507-31f8-4ab1-b376-ec7cd0ff04fe" label="ambiguous">gni ejus non erit finis. Dixit autem</l><l xml:id="m-a39b6d97-5c2f-4238-83ab-341feb055759" facs="#m-7a365f45-b7b5-4106-ae20-02c13b8c38fa" label="lyrics-like">Vírginem desponsátam viro, cui</l><l xml:id="m-83472f4d-a059-4430-b3b7-c12930f1aba0" facs="#m-41672fbd-6628-49ce-9fe4-307d64749534" label="lyrics-like">Marsa ad Angelum: Quómodo fiet</l><l xml:id="m-50c719f2-ca35-404b-8190-e42620495b1f" facs="#m-3e96ace4-e688-473b-b1f0-922d5d3af65c" label="ambiguous">nomen erat Joseph, de domo Da¬</l><l xml:id="m-5e215e1c-144f-4aae-9237-9d5318a585f1" facs="#m-92d84ee7-332f-41ce-bbbb-105e42cad551" label="lyrics-like">istud, quóniam virum non cognó¬</l><l xml:id="m-c228aa56-d2b5-4a68-8955-278071fb573a" facs="#m-8770b374-d01c-41a0-b937-a93dc8f74203" label="ambiguous">vid, et nomen Virginis Maria. Et</l><l xml:id="m-ed75cef3-6d14-4c5f-ad37-705d22d51b8b" facs="#m-1b04fc86-0ace-4a0d-ba55-5d202d471f29" label="lyrics-like">sço? Et respóndens Angelus, dixit</l><l xml:id="m-7ea78f84-0f32-4a7b-bb74-c68587890372" facs="#m-aa39a653-b31c-468b-aea1-a56f8e73301c" label="lyrics-like">ei: Spiritus Sanctus supervéniet in</l><l xml:id="m-b065a4e5-2ef3-46d9-966d-ae99de8e12d6" facs="#m-4025dab7-4417-4f2a-834e-b4df9208da4a" label="lyrics-like">ingréssus Angelus ad eam, dixit:</l><l xml:id="m-e016229a-b48f-4181-9667-29beb5932522" facs="#m-abe725ca-6321-450e-907a-e02f2ce549aa" label="lyrics-like">Ave grátia plena: Dóminus tecum:</l><l xml:id="m-b4fe910f-0d44-4ee4-b9d7-6cc41624c46d" facs="#m-541a56fa-6c56-4d22-b9cf-31429c90281f" label="lyrics-like">te, et virtus Altissimi obumbrábit</l><l xml:id="m-f718a4ab-7e13-44f1-bf3a-7575289eec81" facs="#m-fb2b588b-8dbc-44da-952b-88fe79a7a527" label="lyrics-like">benedicta tu in muliéribus. Quae</l><l xml:id="m-a8cfe2e3-99da-43f0-ba95-c65846e6daee" facs="#m-e8b397df-cf6f-4d12-bccf-6617f349da40" label="lyrics-like">tibi. Ideóque et quod nascétur ex</l><l xml:id="m-27b6751f-6bbe-4073-be02-032878b2976b" facs="#m-e8c1105c-2531-4ffc-b7ba-336482c45484" label="lyrics-like">cum audísset, turbáta est in sermó¬</l><l xml:id="m-bb351606-26b4-43ea-bd61-b4a1f97fa0fb" facs="#m-37dd75f0-c5fb-4497-88e8-c44ef57a314b" label="lyrics-like">te Sanctum, vocábitur Filius Dei.</l><l xml:id="m-a9e6ff73-08a5-474a-92d1-3b7ca3de3d27" facs="#m-ca2c3f5e-3090-43f7-9004-25553e3267ee" label="lyrics-like">ne ejus: et cogitábat qualis esset</l><l xml:id="m-7fcf00ae-48cf-4885-9d4a-3b760ff568ec" facs="#m-f20ffe05-9513-4920-ae5e-f660ce6c515a" label="lyrics-like">Et ecce Elisabeth cognáta tua. et</l><l xml:id="m-6cba0f50-f59f-4214-a1b7-d9b258b16dc0" facs="#m-c3b6e07e-506b-4c4e-91a8-4b6d5747db24" label="lyrics-like">ista salutátio. Et ait Angelus ei:</l><l xml:id="m-02f0c3a4-eae5-4e50-8888-05586f23bc2c" facs="#m-57e1b37e-8616-472c-8874-cf5f7dd46244" label="lyrics-like">ipsa concépit fllium in senectúte</l><l xml:id="m-5a7472e0-f91d-4a58-a727-859b92847cde" facs="#m-37703599-700f-4402-823e-299f8fb9721d" label="lyrics-like">Ne tímeas, Maria, invenisti enim</l><l xml:id="m-2aedf80c-51b0-4f58-98bc-2c865a330643" facs="#m-3243d226-ef4e-460c-87f5-930f7e2d9f70" label="ambiguous">sua: et hic mensis sextus est illi,</l><l xml:id="m-be6db9ef-4444-447d-b651-49874ed92662" facs="#m-b66bbc59-7db2-473c-a550-f94d06e2ea77" label="lyrics-like">grátiam apud Deum: ecce concí¬</l><l xml:id="m-aa55acf8-27a9-4423-8b45-b1e876898454" facs="#m-4b7b3dac-2382-4160-abf0-5e8745385451" label="lyrics-like">quae vocátur stérilis: quia non erit</l><l xml:id="m-a24d2920-f5c2-47ac-ad2c-2eb92b6d995c" facs="#m-ef5c2927-2080-4b5d-912a-6a2db8a3aa5d" label="lyrics-like">pies in útero, et páries filium, et</l><l xml:id="m-3ef7f7e3-86db-4f14-9f3d-222ebff323df" facs="#m-8a3f4030-9fe4-4092-bd1f-0db532a6c288" label="ambiguous">impossibile apud Deum omne ver¬</l><l xml:id="m-d3a62d7e-48b5-4fe5-a5dc-943eb1887d2b" facs="#m-b1d1705c-a7e5-4156-95fc-85fa41ee2d86" label="lyrics-like">vocábis nomen ejus Jesum. Hic erit</l><l xml:id="m-61ac4876-f249-4c6e-97e7-12bf128c5338" facs="#m-506e2792-e711-4ba6-aa4f-603d6998571e" label="ambiguous">bum. Dixit autem Maria: Ecce an¬</l><l xml:id="m-ab58237a-3c3b-4902-9131-b1eb0dcfba91" facs="#m-0b5bd5f3-cf71-44db-8f44-ade880bf0697" label="lyrics-like">magnus, et Filius Altissimi vocábi¬</l><l xml:id="m-055c13d8-20c1-46a5-aa99-576dfff806b4" facs="#m-07d51163-215b-4dee-908b-c5a5046a8188" label="lyrics-like">Icilla Dómini, fiat mihi secúndum</l><l xml:id="m-383d2d45-10ea-4378-a3af-6b13700c98c7" facs="#m-508773e7-5d17-42d6-ac97-5ea97fab1354" label="lyrics-like">tur, et dabit illi Dóminus Deus se-lverbum tuum.</l><l xml:id="m-b7d84e33-db51-420f-8b46-5aa7fc634b11" facs="#m-1496514b-94c9-4425-8a92-8405a5c854be" label="lyrics-like">Offertory. Ave María. p. 355.</l><l xml:id="m-88abe594-97b9-4192-883a-937c67b51705" facs="#m-597528b8-a98b-4751-b977-37d0896ea325" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-2b0dc607-643d-4288-be6f-dbac0e142e80" facs="#m-e2fd699d-a2c6-4d65-b8a3-5f760856d9b1" label="lyrics-like">N méntibus nostris. quaésumus confitémur; per ejus salutíferae re¬</l><l xml:id="m-501832e2-6734-4e39-a454-65bfb5322b6c" facs="#m-919a1c83-6b6f-45bb-a8ab-d332b0c00785" label="lyrics-like">1 Dómine, verae fidei sãcraménta surrectiónis poténtiam, ad aetér¬</l><l xml:id="m-86480880-9bc2-4b02-914a-54c8ed36efc9" facs="#m-c2e8ad6a-f475-46a9-ae23-ecd33e6e322a" label="lyrics-like">confírma: ut, qui concéptum de</l><l xml:id="m-bc711624-ea17-48c8-b400-212ebb1294cf" facs="#m-b24ebda6-4926-4911-912e-172a8522a264" label="lyrics-like">nam mereámur pervenire laetitiam.</l><l xml:id="m-82555ffc-1a17-4f2d-a569-dbdab76f8277" facs="#m-55fb8c0a-3bad-4500-bffc-41233b4da7b9" label="lyrics-like">Virgine Deum verum et hóminem! Per eúmdem Dóminum nostrum.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>